_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; title_text_align=&#8221;left&#8221; title_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; title_active_font=&#8221;|600|||||||&#8221; header_font=&#8221;gilmer-regular||||||||&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;|0px||0px|false|true&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px|0px|0px|0px|true|true&#8221; title_text_align_tablet=&#8221;left&#8221; title_text_align_phone=&#8221;center&#8221; title_text_align_last_edited=&#8221;on|phone&#8221; border_width_bottom_nav_item=&#8221;1px&#8221; border_color_bottom_nav_item=&#8221;#5BA199&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][difl_advancedtabitem title=&#8221;SPEAKING REEL&#8221; at_button_button_url_new_window=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.23.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<video controls poster=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/speaking-ki2t.jpg\"><source src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/Franziska-Iseli-Speaker-Reel.mp4\"><\/video>[\/difl_advancedtabitem][difl_advancedtabitem title=&#8221;TESTIMONIALS&#8221; at_button_button_url_new_window=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.25.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;]<\/p>\n<p><video controls=\"controls\" poster=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/speaking-kit.jpg\"><\/video><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/unnamed-file.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1239 alignnone size-full\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" \/><\/p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"text-align: center;\">I had the most amazing opportunity to meet Franziska in Seoul at the EO Women\u2019s Summit. As soon as I heard her speak I was completely immersed in her story. She took us with her on her journey in the most natural and honest way. We laughed and learned and worked, all at the same time. It was an incredible learning experience. I would love to see her speak again. Thank you for sharing so much of you with us Franziska.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Christianne Steiner, Founder of DISCOVERme<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/unnamed-file.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1239 alignnone size-full\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Franziska&#8217;s story is inspirational. As a leader and long-time member of EO, I found her journey uniquely invigorating. Listening to her, I felt a renewed sense of energy and determination to break boundaries. It&#8217;s rare to find a story that genuinely ignites your passion, and Franziska&#8217;s message is a testament to her incredible zest for life. Her enthusiasm was contagious, filling the room with a vibrant energy that motivated all of us, an already accomplished group of leaders, to push beyond our limits and explore new horizons. She doesn&#8217;t just tell her story; she lives it with a passion that is truly illuminating.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Liza Roeser, The Flower CEO at FiftyFlowers.com<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><\/em>\u00a0<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/unnamed-file.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1239 alignnone size-full\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">I loved Franziska&#8217;s talk on courage and resilience at the EO Global Leadership conference. She&#8217;s so humble and strong at the same time. She takes her audience with her on her extraordinary journey packed with major life topics and value for the entire crowd.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Frido van Mossel, founder of Amsterdam Heritage<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/unnamed-file.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1239 alignnone size-full\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" \/>I wasn&#8217;t sure what to expect in Franziska&#8217;s Courage Map workshop. As a business owner, I&#8217;ve read a lot about courage, risk, and overcoming fear and doubt. Franziska not only shared a different perspective but her life experiences, which transformed these concepts into actions I could take away and start to apply. I loved her storytelling and I took copious notes on the different topics. Many in the room were taking notes and snapping pictures of the slides. I would highly recommend Franziska to any organisation and event organiser.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Sheryle Gillihan, CEO,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/causelabs.com\/\" class=\"ProsemirrorEditor-link\" style=\"color: #808080;\">CauseLabs<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/unnamed-file.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1239 alignnone size-full\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">I saw Franziska present at the Global Leadership Conference in Cape Town. She was phenomenal and captivated the room. I could see people taking notes, I did! Would highly recommend her as a speaker.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Shivani Gupta, CEO of ASKShivani<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/difl_advancedtabitem][difl_advancedtabitem title=&#8221;SPEAKING KIT&#8221; at_button_button_url_new_window=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.23.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/speaking-kitb-1-1024x742.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"742\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1180 alignnone size-large\" srcset=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/speaking-kitb-1-1024x742.png 1024w, https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/speaking-kitb-1-980x711.png 980w, https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/speaking-kitb-1-480x348.png 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1024px, 100vw\" \/><\/p>\n<p><a class=\"et_pb_button et_pb_button_0_tb_footer et_pb_bg_layout_light\">Download Speaking Kit<\/a><\/p>\n<p>[\/difl_advancedtabitem][difl_advancedtabitem title=&#8221;ASSETS&#8221; at_button_button_url_new_window=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.23.1&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; header_5_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; header_6_text_color=&#8221;#5BA199&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 11.2473%;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Mask-Group-10@2x.png\" width=\"91\" height=\"67\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1190 alignnone size-full\" \/><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 91.7527%;\">\n<h5>The Courage Map<\/h5>\n<h6><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/franziskaiseli.c